  "bio": "Rachel Marley is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray and floral designs, whose fine work can be found at Alan's Tattoo Studio in Wirral, UK. With a keen eye for detail, she transforms skin into a canvas of beautiful, intricate artistry, ensuring each client leaves with a wearable masterpiece that holds its beauty over time. Her professionalism is evident in both the precision of her tattoos and the meticulous care she puts into maintaining a clean and organized work environment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wirral, England, United Kingdom"
